<p>
  This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{{ biz_name }}</strong> ("we", "us", "our")
  collects, uses, shares and protects your personal information when you visit or make a
  purchase from our online store.
</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>When you use our store, we may collect the following:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Identity &amp; contact data</strong> — name, email address, phone number, billing and shipping address.</li>
  <li><strong>Order data</strong> — products purchased, order value, and transaction history.</li>
  <li><strong>Payment data</strong> — payment method details are collected and processed securely by our payment gateway, <strong>Razorpay</strong>. We do not store your full card, UPI or bank details on our servers.</li>
  <li><strong>Technical data</strong> — IP address, browser type, device information, and pages viewed, collected via cookies and similar technologies.</li>
  <li><strong>Communications</strong> — messages you send us and marketing preferences.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To process, fulfil and deliver your orders.</li>
  <li>To take and confirm payments through Razorpay.</li>
  <li>To communicate with you about orders, support requests and, where you have opted in, marketing.</li>
  <li>To prevent fraud and keep our store secure.</li>
  <li>To comply with our legal and tax obligations.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Payments &amp; Razorpay</h2>
<p>
  Online payments on our store are processed by <strong>Razorpay Software Private Limited</strong>.
  When you pay, the information required to complete the transaction (such as your name, contact
  details, amount and payment credentials) is shared directly with Razorpay through a secure,
  encrypted connection. Razorpay processes this data as an independent payment processor in
  accordance with its own privacy policy and applicable payment-industry (PCI-DSS) standards.
  We receive only a confirmation of payment and limited transaction details — never your full
  card or bank credentials.
</p>

<h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
<p>We share personal information only where necessary, with:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Payment processors</strong> — Razorpay, to process your payment.</li>
  <li><strong>Our e-commerce platform</strong> — Shopify, which hosts our store and order data.</li>
  <li><strong>Logistics &amp; courier partners</strong> — to deliver your orders.</li>
  <li><strong>Service providers</strong> — for analytics, email and customer support, under confidentiality obligations.</li>
  <li><strong>Authorities</strong> — where required by law or to protect our legal rights.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

<h2>5. Cookies</h2>
<p>
  We use cookies to keep your cart working, remember preferences, and understand how the store is
  used. You can control cookies through your browser settings, though some features may not work
  correctly if disabled.
</p>

<h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
<p>
  We keep your personal information only for as long as needed to fulfil the purposes described
  here, including order records required for accounting, tax and legal compliance.
</p>

<h2>7. Security</h2>
<p>
  We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your information. Payment
  data is handled over encrypted connections by Razorpay. However, no method of transmission over
  the internet is completely secure.
</p>

<h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
<p>
  Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
  personal data, and you may withdraw consent to marketing at any time. To exercise these rights,
  contact us using the details below.
</p>

<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our store is not directed at children under 18, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>

<h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
  We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be posted on
  this page.
</p>

<h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
<p>
  If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, contact us at
  <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>{% if address != blank %}, or write to us at {{ address }}{% endif %}.
</p>
